&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with GraphQL APIs and high-throughput, multi-tenant data services&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
