&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to ensuring that all candidates have an equal opportunity to participate in our interview process. If you require accommodations at any stage of the process due to a disability, medical condition, or any other circumstance, please don&#39;t hesitate to submit your request by filling out this &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/V7k3t4u9j523XkEt6&quot;&gt;form&lt;/a&gt;. We will work with you to provide reasonable accommodations to facilitate your participation and ensure a fair and accessible interview experience. Your request and any information provided will be kept confidential and will not impact your candidacy. We look forward to hearing from you and accommodating your needs to the best of our ability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":4023493003,"name":"Finance Department","child_ids":[],"parent_id":4051563003}],"offices":[{"id":4015241003,"name":"IND - Bengaluru","location":"Bengaluru, Karnataka, India, APAC","child_ids":[],"parent_id":4035902003}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":false,"ai_opt_out_request_url":"http://app3.greenhouse.io/ai_opt_out_request/job_post/7818366003/ai_opt_out"},{"absolute_url":"https://www.fivetran.com/careers/job?gh_jid=8014679003","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":5891907003,"location":{"name":"Oakland, California, United States, AMER"},"metadata":[{"id":4426110003,"name":"Employee Type","value":"Regular","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":41172869003,"name":"Priority Status","value":null,"value_type":"short_text"}],"id":8014679003,"updated_at":"2026-10-26T19:17:17-04:00","requisition_id":"JR103437","title":"Growth Marketing Strategy & Planning Manager","company_name":"Fivetran ","first_published":"2026-10-06T12:07:44-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;From Fivetran’s founding until now, our mission has remained the same: to make access to data as simple and reliable as electricity. With Fivetran, customer data arrives in their warehouses, canonical and ready to query, with no engineering or maintenance required. We’re proud that more organizations continue to leverage our technology every day to become truly data-driven.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Fivetran and dbt Labs are bringing together two industry-leading companies with a shared mission: helping organizations unlock the full value of their data. Together, we’re delivering the data infrastructure layer that helps organizations move, transform, and trust their data — from the moment data moves, through every transformation, to the context teams and AI systems rely on. Fivetran helps organizations automate data movement across the systems, clouds, engines, and tools they rely on. dbt Labs pioneered analytics engineering, helping teams transform data into reliable, governed insights. Together, we support thousands of organizations as they build a trusted foundation for analytics, AI, and better business decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As we bring our teams and technology together, we’re building on the strengths of both companies while continuing to deliver the products and experiences our customers know and trust. It’s an exciting time to join us: we’re creating a company with the scale, talent, and technology to help more organizations put their data to work with greater speed, confidence, and impact.&amp;nbsp;During this transition period, you may see references to both Fivetran and dbt Labs throughout our recruiting process as we integrate our teams, systems, and career sites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The Growth Marketing Strategy and Planning Manager sits at the intersection of B2B marketing strategy and performance analytics. You sit within GTM Strategy &amp;amp; Planning and act as the right hand to the VP of Growth - helping the team decide where to spend their next dollar, setting marketing-level targets in partnership with Finance, and making recommendations of how to maximize the revenue yield from demand.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The marketing team you’ll be supporting owns the digital/technical marketing channels that are heavily reliant on data-driven decisions and insights. The team’s outcomes support both the sales-led business and our PLG motion, and we make decisions around lead routing between the two businesses so that we maximize revenue yield.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a high visibility role with direct exposure to marketing leadership. We&#39;re looking for someone who brings structure to ambiguity, has the business judgment to challenge assumptions, and can move fast without sacrificing rigor. You translate performance data into investment decisions and defend those decisions to senior stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a full-time position based out of our Oakland, Denver, Austin, or New York City offices. Our hybrid work model offers a blend of remote flexibility and in-person collaboration, including one to two days in the office each week to connect and build as a team. &lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Target Setting and Impact Measurement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own annual and quarterly target setting for the Growth marketing organization, including channel-level targets and budget allocation driven by a documented planning model&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support annual budgeting and in-quarter re-planning with recommendations on investment levels and channel mix&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own marketing ROI analysis: calculate and report on cost-per-lead, cost-per-opportunity, CAC by channel, and marketing efficiency ratios&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Develop segment and region level views of marketing performance to support resource allocation decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Design and maintain models to quantify the impact of marketing programs across the buyer journey&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Conduct ad hoc deep dives to diagnose pipeline trends, marketing channel performance, or funnel conversion issues and proactively surface recommendations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive reporting &amp;amp; Cross-functional Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support the weekly and monthly business review process: prepare data and partner with leadership to build a narrative that converts data into actionable insights&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Drive alignment on ICP across product marketing, product, sales, and marketing so targeting, messaging, and investment point at the same accounts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Scope dashboard needs and partner with the Analytics team to build them out&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Pipeline model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own the Growth pipeline model, aligning sourced and influenced contribution across partner, sales, BDR, and marketing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Work with Field Ops for Commercial and the BDR org to ensure marketing&#39;s pipeline contribution supports the coverage needed to hit the business target&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain the coverage, conversion, and velocity assumptions the model runs on, and reconcile them with Field Ops and Finance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimentation and Optimization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Analyze marketing experiments (landing pages, email sequences, ad creative, offers) to drive continuous improvement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with our Head of PLG Revenue to identify friction in the self serve funnel and recommend interventions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Design experiments that help optimize the marketing spend and pipeline ROI&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capacity &amp;amp; headcount planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own capacity and headcount planning for the Growth marketing organization, tying resourcing to targets and coverage requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Model the trade-offs between headcount, program spend, and pipeline output to inform investment and org decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;4 to 7 years of experience in marketing analytics, GTM/marketing strategy, revenue operations analytics, FP&amp;amp;A or business intelligence within a B2B SaaS environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong planning and financial-modeling skills: comfortable building target, budget, and pipeline-coverage models from ambiguous inputs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to independently structure ambiguous problems, move quickly, and drive them to clear, actionable recommendations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Clear point of view and the confidence to challenge assumptions and bring data-backed perspectives to senior stakeholders, including a VP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Comfort operating in a fast-changing environment where definitions, targets, and operating models are still evolving, and the ability to balance speed with rigor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Understanding of B2B SaaS performance metrics: pipeline, ACV, conversion rates, velocity, marketing-sourced vs. influenced pipeline, and attribution concepts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Comfortable with SQL, Excel/google sheets and BI/visualization tools like Looker to move quickly through data&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of Salesforce (reports, dashboards, opportunity data), marketing automation platforms (Marketo preferred), and ad platforms (Demandbase, Google Ads, LinkedIn Ads, chatgpt Ads, etc)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Skills​&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Python or R proficiency for statistical analysis, automation, or building lightweight models&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with multi-touch attribution platforms (Bizible/Marketo)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Exposure to experiment design, significance testing, or applied statistics in a marketing context&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with predictive modeling: LTV estimation, propensity scoring, or cohort analysis applied to marketing audiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with the modern data stack (Fivetran, dbt, Snowflake, Looker)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Background in data infrastructure, developer tools, or analytics software industries&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID &lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;#LI-MM1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The compensation range displayed on this job posting reflects the minimum and maximum target for new hire compensation for the target position and level, and may include sales incentives or target bonuses depending on the role. &amp;nbsp;Our compensation ranges are determined by role, level, and location. Our job titles may span more than one career level. Within the range, individual compensation is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, relevant education or training, business need, market demands. The compensation range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. Your recruiter can share more about the specific compensation range for your location during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Oakland Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$150,573&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$188,216 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% employer-paid medical insurance&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Generous paid time away from work, including paid vacation or flexible/unlimited vacation depending on role and country, plus paid sick time, inclusive parental leave, paid holidays, including a year-end Global Week of Rest, and volunteer days off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RSU stock grants*&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development and training opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company virtual happy hours, free food, and fun team-building activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly cell phone stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to an innovative mental health support platform that offers personalized care and resources in areas such as: therapy, coaching, and self-guided mindfulness exercises for all covered employees and their covered dependents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;May vary by country and worker type - please reach out to your recruiter for more information&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CdawUwjo1Q1B7ghZJ_owdmmHB8VtqhBu?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about Fivetran&#39;s Benefits by Region.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;We’re honored to be &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;valued at over $5.6 billion&lt;/a&gt;, but more importantly, we’re proud of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;core values of Get Stuck In, Do the Right Thing, and One Team, One Dream&lt;/a&gt;. Read about us in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Forbes&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;Fivetran brings together high-quality talent across the globe to make data access as easy and reliable as electricity for our customers. We value and recognize that our customers benefit from having innovative teams made of people from many backgrounds, experiences, and identities. Fivetran promotes diversity, equity, inclusion &amp;amp; belonging through attracting, recruiting, developing, and retaining a diverse workforce, not only because it is the right thing to do, but because it helps us build a world-class company to better serve our customers, our people and our communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about Fivetran’s culture and what it’s like to be part of the team, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xlhtp4dGh8o&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; and enjoy our video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about our candidate privacy policy, you can &lt;a href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/candidate-privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;read our statement here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to ensuring that all candidates have an equal opportunity to participate in our interview process. If you require accommodations at any stage of the process due to a disability, medical condition, or any other circumstance, please don&#39;t hesitate to submit your request by filling out this &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/V7k3t4u9j523XkEt6&quot;&gt;form&lt;/a&gt;. We will work with you to provide reasonable accommodations to facilitate your participation and ensure a fair and accessible interview experience. Your request and any information provided will be kept confidential and will not impact your candidacy. We look forward to hearing from you and accommodating your needs to the best of our ability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":4163840003,"name":"Strategy & Operations Department","child_ids":[],"parent_id":4051565003}],"offices":[{"id":4015137003,"name":"USA - Oakland","location":"Oakland, California, United States, AMER","child_ids":[],"parent_id":4035898003}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":false,"ai_opt_out_request_url":"http://app3.greenhouse.io/ai_opt_out_request/job_post/8014679003/ai_opt_out"},{"absolute_url":"https://www.fivetran.com/careers/job?gh_jid=8014680003","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":5891907003,"location":{"name":"USA - New York"},"metadata":[{"id":4426110003,"name":"Employee Type","value":"Regular","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":41172869003,"name":"Priority Status","value":null,"value_type":"short_text"}],"id":8014680003,"updated_at":"2026-10-26T19:17:17-04:00","requisition_id":"JR103437","title":"Growth Marketing Strategy & Planning Manager","company_name":"Fivetran ","first_published":"2026-10-06T12:07:45-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;From Fivetran’s founding until now, our mission has remained the same: to make access to data as simple and reliable as electricity. With Fivetran, customer data arrives in their warehouses, canonical and ready to query, with no engineering or maintenance required. We’re proud that more organizations continue to leverage our technology every day to become truly data-driven.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Fivetran and dbt Labs are bringing together two industry-leading companies with a shared mission: helping organizations unlock the full value of their data. Together, we’re delivering the data infrastructure layer that helps organizations move, transform, and trust their data — from the moment data moves, through every transformation, to the context teams and AI systems rely on. Fivetran helps organizations automate data movement across the systems, clouds, engines, and tools they rely on. dbt Labs pioneered analytics engineering, helping teams transform data into reliable, governed insights. Together, we support thousands of organizations as they build a trusted foundation for analytics, AI, and better business decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As we bring our teams and technology together, we’re building on the strengths of both companies while continuing to deliver the products and experiences our customers know and trust. It’s an exciting time to join us: we’re creating a company with the scale, talent, and technology to help more organizations put their data to work with greater speed, confidence, and impact.&amp;nbsp;During this transition period, you may see references to both Fivetran and dbt Labs throughout our recruiting process as we integrate our teams, systems, and career sites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The Growth Marketing Strategy and Planning Manager sits at the intersection of B2B marketing strategy and performance analytics. You sit within GTM Strategy &amp;amp; Planning and act as the right hand to the VP of Growth - helping the team decide where to spend their next dollar, setting marketing-level targets in partnership with Finance, and making recommendations of how to maximize the revenue yield from demand.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The marketing team you’ll be supporting owns the digital/technical marketing channels that are heavily reliant on data-driven decisions and insights. The team’s outcomes support both the sales-led business and our PLG motion, and we make decisions around lead routing between the two businesses so that we maximize revenue yield.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a high visibility role with direct exposure to marketing leadership. We&#39;re looking for someone who brings structure to ambiguity, has the business judgment to challenge assumptions, and can move fast without sacrificing rigor. You translate performance data into investment decisions and defend those decisions to senior stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a full-time position based out of our Oakland, Denver, Austin, or New York City offices. Our hybrid work model offers a blend of remote flexibility and in-person collaboration, including one to two days in the office each week to connect and build as a team. &lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Target Setting and Impact Measurement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own annual and quarterly target setting for the Growth marketing organization, including channel-level targets and budget allocation driven by a documented planning model&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support annual budgeting and in-quarter re-planning with recommendations on investment levels and channel mix&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own marketing ROI analysis: calculate and report on cost-per-lead, cost-per-opportunity, CAC by channel, and marketing efficiency ratios&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Develop segment and region level views of marketing performance to support resource allocation decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Design and maintain models to quantify the impact of marketing programs across the buyer journey&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Conduct ad hoc deep dives to diagnose pipeline trends, marketing channel performance, or funnel conversion issues and proactively surface recommendations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive reporting &amp;amp; Cross-functional Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support the weekly and monthly business review process: prepare data and partner with leadership to build a narrative that converts data into actionable insights&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Drive alignment on ICP across product marketing, product, sales, and marketing so targeting, messaging, and investment point at the same accounts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Scope dashboard needs and partner with the Analytics team to build them out&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Pipeline model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own the Growth pipeline model, aligning sourced and influenced contribution across partner, sales, BDR, and marketing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Work with Field Ops for Commercial and the BDR org to ensure marketing&#39;s pipeline contribution supports the coverage needed to hit the business target&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain the coverage, conversion, and velocity assumptions the model runs on, and reconcile them with Field Ops and Finance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimentation and Optimization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Analyze marketing experiments (landing pages, email sequences, ad creative, offers) to drive continuous improvement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with our Head of PLG Revenue to identify friction in the self serve funnel and recommend interventions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Design experiments that help optimize the marketing spend and pipeline ROI&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capacity &amp;amp; headcount planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own capacity and headcount planning for the Growth marketing organization, tying resourcing to targets and coverage requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Model the trade-offs between headcount, program spend, and pipeline output to inform investment and org decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;4 to 7 years of experience in marketing analytics, GTM/marketing strategy, revenue operations analytics, FP&amp;amp;A or business intelligence within a B2B SaaS environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong planning and financial-modeling skills: comfortable building target, budget, and pipeline-coverage models from ambiguous inputs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to independently structure ambiguous problems, move quickly, and drive them to clear, actionable recommendations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Clear point of view and the confidence to challenge assumptions and bring data-backed perspectives to senior stakeholders, including a VP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Comfort operating in a fast-changing environment where definitions, targets, and operating models are still evolving, and the ability to balance speed with rigor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Understanding of B2B SaaS performance metrics: pipeline, ACV, conversion rates, velocity, marketing-sourced vs. influenced pipeline, and attribution concepts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Comfortable with SQL, Excel/google sheets and BI/visualization tools like Looker to move quickly through data&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of Salesforce (reports, dashboards, opportunity data), marketing automation platforms (Marketo preferred), and ad platforms (Demandbase, Google Ads, LinkedIn Ads, chatgpt Ads, etc)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Skills​&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Python or R proficiency for statistical analysis, automation, or building lightweight models&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with multi-touch attribution platforms (Bizible/Marketo)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Exposure to experiment design, significance testing, or applied statistics in a marketing context&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with predictive modeling: LTV estimation, propensity scoring, or cohort analysis applied to marketing audiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with the modern data stack (Fivetran, dbt, Snowflake, Looker)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Background in data infrastructure, developer tools, or analytics software industries&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID &lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;#LI-MM1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The compensation range displayed on this job posting reflects the minimum and maximum target for new hire compensation for the target position and level, and may include sales incentives or target bonuses depending on the role. &amp;nbsp;Our compensation ranges are determined by role, level, and location. Our job titles may span more than one career level. Within the range, individual compensation is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, relevant education or training, business need, market demands. The compensation range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. Your recruiter can share more about the specific compensation range for your location during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;New York Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$150,573&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$188,216 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% employer-paid medical insurance&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Generous paid time away from work, including paid vacation or flexible/unlimited vacation depending on role and country, plus paid sick time, inclusive parental leave, paid holidays, including a year-end Global Week of Rest, and volunteer days off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RSU stock grants*&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development and training opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company virtual happy hours, free food, and fun team-building activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly cell phone stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to an innovative mental health support platform that offers personalized care and resources in areas such as: therapy, coaching, and self-guided mindfulness exercises for all covered employees and their covered dependents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;May vary by country and worker type - please reach out to your recruiter for more information&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CdawUwjo1Q1B7ghZJ_owdmmHB8VtqhBu?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about Fivetran&#39;s Benefits by Region.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;We’re honored to be &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;valued at over $5.6 billion&lt;/a&gt;, but more importantly, we’re proud of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;core values of Get Stuck In, Do the Right Thing, and One Team, One Dream&lt;/a&gt;. Read about us in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Forbes&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;Fivetran brings together high-quality talent across the globe to make data access as easy and reliable as electricity for our customers. We value and recognize that our customers benefit from having innovative teams made of people from many backgrounds, experiences, and identities. Fivetran promotes diversity, equity, inclusion &amp;amp; belonging through attracting, recruiting, developing, and retaining a diverse workforce, not only because it is the right thing to do, but because it helps us build a world-class company to better serve our customers, our people and our communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about Fivetran’s culture and what it’s like to be part of the team, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xlhtp4dGh8o&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; and enjoy our video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about our candidate privacy policy, you can &lt;a href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/candidate-privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;read our statement here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to ensuring that all candidates have an equal opportunity to participate in our interview process. If you require accommodations at any stage of the process due to a disability, medical condition, or any other circumstance, please don&#39;t hesitate to submit your request by filling out this &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/V7k3t4u9j523XkEt6&quot;&gt;form&lt;/a&gt;. We will work with you to provide reasonable accommodations to facilitate your participation and ensure a fair and accessible interview experience. Your request and any information provided will be kept confidential and will not impact your candidacy. We look forward to hearing from you and accommodating your needs to the best of our ability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":4163840003,"name":"Strategy & Operations Department","child_ids":[],"parent_id":4051565003}],"offices":[{"id":4015137003,"name":"USA - Oakland","location":"Oakland, California, United States, AMER","child_ids":[],"parent_id":4035898003}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":false,"ai_opt_out_request_url":"http://app3.greenhouse.io/ai_opt_out_request/job_post/8014680003/ai_opt_out"},{"absolute_url":"https://www.fivetran.com/careers/job?gh_jid=8014678003","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":5891907003,"location":{"name":"USA - Austin (dbt)"},"metadata":[{"id":4426110003,"name":"Employee Type","value":"Regular","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":41172869003,"name":"Priority Status","value":null,"value_type":"short_text"}],"id":8014678003,"updated_at":"2026-10-26T19:17:17-04:00","requisition_id":"JR103437","title":"Growth Marketing Strategy & Planning Manager","company_name":"Fivetran ","first_published":"2026-10-06T12:07:42-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;From Fivetran’s founding until now, our mission has remained the same: to make access to data as simple and reliable as electricity. With Fivetran, customer data arrives in their warehouses, canonical and ready to query, with no engineering or maintenance required. We’re proud that more organizations continue to leverage our technology every day to become truly data-driven.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Fivetran and dbt Labs are bringing together two industry-leading companies with a shared mission: helping organizations unlock the full value of their data. Together, we’re delivering the data infrastructure layer that helps organizations move, transform, and trust their data — from the moment data moves, through every transformation, to the context teams and AI systems rely on. Fivetran helps organizations automate data movement across the systems, clouds, engines, and tools they rely on. dbt Labs pioneered analytics engineering, helping teams transform data into reliable, governed insights. Together, we support thousands of organizations as they build a trusted foundation for analytics, AI, and better business decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As we bring our teams and technology together, we’re building on the strengths of both companies while continuing to deliver the products and experiences our customers know and trust. It’s an exciting time to join us: we’re creating a company with the scale, talent, and technology to help more organizations put their data to work with greater speed, confidence, and impact.&amp;nbsp;During this transition period, you may see references to both Fivetran and dbt Labs throughout our recruiting process as we integrate our teams, systems, and career sites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The Growth Marketing Strategy and Planning Manager sits at the intersection of B2B marketing strategy and performance analytics. You sit within GTM Strategy &amp;amp; Planning and act as the right hand to the VP of Growth - helping the team decide where to spend their next dollar, setting marketing-level targets in partnership with Finance, and making recommendations of how to maximize the revenue yield from demand.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The marketing team you’ll be supporting owns the digital/technical marketing channels that are heavily reliant on data-driven decisions and insights. The team’s outcomes support both the sales-led business and our PLG motion, and we make decisions around lead routing between the two businesses so that we maximize revenue yield.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a high visibility role with direct exposure to marketing leadership. We&#39;re looking for someone who brings structure to ambiguity, has the business judgment to challenge assumptions, and can move fast without sacrificing rigor. You translate performance data into investment decisions and defend those decisions to senior stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a full-time position based out of our Oakland, Denver, Austin, or New York City offices. Our hybrid work model offers a blend of remote flexibility and in-person collaboration, including one to two days in the office each week to connect and build as a team. &lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Target Setting and Impact Measurement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own annual and quarterly target setting for the Growth marketing organization, including channel-level targets and budget allocation driven by a documented planning model&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support annual budgeting and in-quarter re-planning with recommendations on investment levels and channel mix&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own marketing ROI analysis: calculate and report on cost-per-lead, cost-per-opportunity, CAC by channel, and marketing efficiency ratios&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Develop segment and region level views of marketing performance to support resource allocation decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Design and maintain models to quantify the impact of marketing programs across the buyer journey&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Conduct ad hoc deep dives to diagnose pipeline trends, marketing channel performance, or funnel conversion issues and proactively surface recommendations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive reporting &amp;amp; Cross-functional Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support the weekly and monthly business review process: prepare data and partner with leadership to build a narrative that converts data into actionable insights&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Drive alignment on ICP across product marketing, product, sales, and marketing so targeting, messaging, and investment point at the same accounts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Scope dashboard needs and partner with the Analytics team to build them out&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Pipeline model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own the Growth pipeline model, aligning sourced and influenced contribution across partner, sales, BDR, and marketing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Work with Field Ops for Commercial and the BDR org to ensure marketing&#39;s pipeline contribution supports the coverage needed to hit the business target&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain the coverage, conversion, and velocity assumptions the model runs on, and reconcile them with Field Ops and Finance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimentation and Optimization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Analyze marketing experiments (landing pages, email sequences, ad creative, offers) to drive continuous improvement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with our Head of PLG Revenue to identify friction in the self serve funnel and recommend interventions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Design experiments that help optimize the marketing spend and pipeline ROI&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capacity &amp;amp; headcount planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own capacity and headcount planning for the Growth marketing organization, tying resourcing to targets and coverage requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Model the trade-offs between headcount, program spend, and pipeline output to inform investment and org decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;4 to 7 years of experience in marketing analytics, GTM/marketing strategy, revenue operations analytics, FP&amp;amp;A or business intelligence within a B2B SaaS environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong planning and financial-modeling skills: comfortable building target, budget, and pipeline-coverage models from ambiguous inputs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to independently structure ambiguous problems, move quickly, and drive them to clear, actionable recommendations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Clear point of view and the confidence to challenge assumptions and bring data-backed perspectives to senior stakeholders, including a VP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Comfort operating in a fast-changing environment where definitions, targets, and operating models are still evolving, and the ability to balance speed with rigor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Understanding of B2B SaaS performance metrics: pipeline, ACV, conversion rates, velocity, marketing-sourced vs. influenced pipeline, and attribution concepts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Comfortable with SQL, Excel/google sheets and BI/visualization tools like Looker to move quickly through data&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of Salesforce (reports, dashboards, opportunity data), marketing automation platforms (Marketo preferred), and ad platforms (Demandbase, Google Ads, LinkedIn Ads, chatgpt Ads, etc)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Skills​&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Python or R proficiency for statistical analysis, automation, or building lightweight models&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with multi-touch attribution platforms (Bizible/Marketo)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Exposure to experiment design, significance testing, or applied statistics in a marketing context&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with predictive modeling: LTV estimation, propensity scoring, or cohort analysis applied to marketing audiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with the modern data stack (Fivetran, dbt, Snowflake, Looker)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Background in data infrastructure, developer tools, or analytics software industries&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID &lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;#LI-MM1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The compensation range displayed on this job posting reflects the minimum and maximum target for new hire compensation for the target position and level, and may include sales incentives or target bonuses depending on the role. &amp;nbsp;Our compensation ranges are determined by role, level, and location. Our job titles may span more than one career level. Within the range, individual compensation is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, relevant education or training, business need, market demands. The compensation range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. Your recruiter can share more about the specific compensation range for your location during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$141,162&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$176,452.50 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% employer-paid medical insurance&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Generous paid time away from work, including paid vacation or flexible/unlimited vacation depending on role and country, plus paid sick time, inclusive parental leave, paid holidays, including a year-end Global Week of Rest, and volunteer days off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RSU stock grants*&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development and training opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company virtual happy hours, free food, and fun team-building activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly cell phone stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to an innovative mental health support platform that offers personalized care and resources in areas such as: therapy, coaching, and self-guided mindfulness exercises for all covered employees and their covered dependents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;May vary by country and worker type - please reach out to your recruiter for more information&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CdawUwjo1Q1B7ghZJ_owdmmHB8VtqhBu?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about Fivetran&#39;s Benefits by Region.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;We’re honored to be &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;valued at over $5.6 billion&lt;/a&gt;, but more importantly, we’re proud of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;core values of Get Stuck In, Do the Right Thing, and One Team, One Dream&lt;/a&gt;. Read about us in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Forbes&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;Fivetran brings together high-quality talent across the globe to make data access as easy and reliable as electricity for our customers. We value and recognize that our customers benefit from having innovative teams made of people from many backgrounds, experiences, and identities. Fivetran promotes diversity, equity, inclusion &amp;amp; belonging through attracting, recruiting, developing, and retaining a diverse workforce, not only because it is the right thing to do, but because it helps us build a world-class company to better serve our customers, our people and our communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about Fivetran’s culture and what it’s like to be part of the team, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xlhtp4dGh8o&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; and enjoy our video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about our candidate privacy policy, you can &lt;a href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/candidate-privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;read our statement here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to ensuring that all candidates have an equal opportunity to participate in our interview process. If you require accommodations at any stage of the process due to a disability, medical condition, or any other circumstance, please don&#39;t hesitate to submit your request by filling out this &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/V7k3t4u9j523XkEt6&quot;&gt;form&lt;/a&gt;. We will work with you to provide reasonable accommodations to facilitate your participation and ensure a fair and accessible interview experience. Your request and any information provided will be kept confidential and will not impact your candidacy. We look forward to hearing from you and accommodating your needs to the best of our ability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":4163840003,"name":"Strategy & Operations Department","child_ids":[],"parent_id":4051565003}],"offices":[{"id":4015137003,"name":"USA - Oakland","location":"Oakland, California, United States, AMER","child_ids":[],"parent_id":4035898003}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":false,"ai_opt_out_request_url":"http://app3.greenhouse.io/ai_opt_out_request/job_post/8014678003/ai_opt_out"},{"absolute_url":"https://www.fivetran.com/careers/job?gh_jid=8009202003","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":5891907003,"location":{"name":"Denver, Colorado, United States, AMER"},"metadata":[{"id":4426110003,"name":"Employee Type","value":"Regular","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":41172869003,"name":"Priority Status","value":null,"value_type":"short_text"}],"id":8009202003,"updated_at":"2026-10-26T19:17:17-04:00","requisition_id":"JR103437","title":"Growth Marketing Strategy & Planning Manager","company_name":"Fivetran ","first_published":"2026-09-30T17:40:18-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;From Fivetran’s founding until now, our mission has remained the same: to make access to data as simple and reliable as electricity. With Fivetran, customer data arrives in their warehouses, canonical and ready to query, with no engineering or maintenance required. We’re proud that more organizations continue to leverage our technology every day to become truly data-driven.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Fivetran and dbt Labs are bringing together two industry-leading companies with a shared mission: helping organizations unlock the full value of their data. Together, we’re delivering the data infrastructure layer that helps organizations move, transform, and trust their data — from the moment data moves, through every transformation, to the context teams and AI systems rely on. Fivetran helps organizations automate data movement across the systems, clouds, engines, and tools they rely on. dbt Labs pioneered analytics engineering, helping teams transform data into reliable, governed insights. Together, we support thousands of organizations as they build a trusted foundation for analytics, AI, and better business decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As we bring our teams and technology together, we’re building on the strengths of both companies while continuing to deliver the products and experiences our customers know and trust. It’s an exciting time to join us: we’re creating a company with the scale, talent, and technology to help more organizations put their data to work with greater speed, confidence, and impact.&amp;nbsp;During this transition period, you may see references to both Fivetran and dbt Labs throughout our recruiting process as we integrate our teams, systems, and career sites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The Growth Marketing Strategy and Planning Manager sits at the intersection of B2B marketing strategy and performance analytics. You sit within GTM Strategy &amp;amp; Planning and act as the right hand to the VP of Growth - helping the team decide where to spend their next dollar, setting marketing-level targets in partnership with Finance, and making recommendations of how to maximize the revenue yield from demand.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The marketing team you’ll be supporting owns the digital/technical marketing channels that are heavily reliant on data-driven decisions and insights. The team’s outcomes support both the sales-led business and our PLG motion, and we make decisions around lead routing between the two businesses so that we maximize revenue yield.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a high visibility role with direct exposure to marketing leadership. We&#39;re looking for someone who brings structure to ambiguity, has the business judgment to challenge assumptions, and can move fast without sacrificing rigor. You translate performance data into investment decisions and defend those decisions to senior stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a full-time position based out of our Oakland, Denver, Austin, or New York City offices. Our hybrid work model offers a blend of remote flexibility and in-person collaboration, including one to two days in the office each week to connect and build as a team. &lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Target Setting and Impact Measurement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own annual and quarterly target setting for the Growth marketing organization, including channel-level targets and budget allocation driven by a documented planning model&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support annual budgeting and in-quarter re-planning with recommendations on investment levels and channel mix&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own marketing ROI analysis: calculate and report on cost-per-lead, cost-per-opportunity, CAC by channel, and marketing efficiency ratios&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Develop segment and region level views of marketing performance to support resource allocation decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Design and maintain models to quantify the impact of marketing programs across the buyer journey&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Conduct ad hoc deep dives to diagnose pipeline trends, marketing channel performance, or funnel conversion issues and proactively surface recommendations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive reporting &amp;amp; Cross-functional Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support the weekly and monthly business review process: prepare data and partner with leadership to build a narrative that converts data into actionable insights&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Drive alignment on ICP across product marketing, product, sales, and marketing so targeting, messaging, and investment point at the same accounts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Scope dashboard needs and partner with the Analytics team to build them out&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Pipeline model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own the Growth pipeline model, aligning sourced and influenced contribution across partner, sales, BDR, and marketing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Work with Field Ops for Commercial and the BDR org to ensure marketing&#39;s pipeline contribution supports the coverage needed to hit the business target&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain the coverage, conversion, and velocity assumptions the model runs on, and reconcile them with Field Ops and Finance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimentation and Optimization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Analyze marketing experiments (landing pages, email sequences, ad creative, offers) to drive continuous improvement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with our Head of PLG Revenue to identify friction in the self serve funnel and recommend interventions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Design experiments that help optimize the marketing spend and pipeline ROI&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capacity &amp;amp; headcount planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own capacity and headcount planning for the Growth marketing organization, tying resourcing to targets and coverage requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Model the trade-offs between headcount, program spend, and pipeline output to inform investment and org decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;4 to 7 years of experience in marketing analytics, GTM/marketing strategy, revenue operations analytics, FP&amp;amp;A or business intelligence within a B2B SaaS environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong planning and financial-modeling skills: comfortable building target, budget, and pipeline-coverage models from ambiguous inputs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to independently structure ambiguous problems, move quickly, and drive them to clear, actionable recommendations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Clear point of view and the confidence to challenge assumptions and bring data-backed perspectives to senior stakeholders, including a VP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Comfort operating in a fast-changing environment where definitions, targets, and operating models are still evolving, and the ability to balance speed with rigor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Understanding of B2B SaaS performance metrics: pipeline, ACV, conversion rates, velocity, marketing-sourced vs. influenced pipeline, and attribution concepts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Comfortable with SQL, Excel/google sheets and BI/visualization tools like Looker to move quickly through data&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of Salesforce (reports, dashboards, opportunity data), marketing automation platforms (Marketo preferred), and ad platforms (Demandbase, Google Ads, LinkedIn Ads, chatgpt Ads, etc)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Skills​&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Python or R proficiency for statistical analysis, automation, or building lightweight models&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with multi-touch attribution platforms (Bizible/Marketo)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Exposure to experiment design, significance testing, or applied statistics in a marketing context&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with predictive modeling: LTV estimation, propensity scoring, or cohort analysis applied to marketing audiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with the modern data stack (Fivetran, dbt, Snowflake, Looker)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Background in data infrastructure, developer tools, or analytics software industries&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID &lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;#LI-MM1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The compensation range displayed on this job posting reflects the minimum and maximum target for new hire compensation for the target position and level, and may include sales incentives or target bonuses depending on the role. &amp;nbsp;Our compensation ranges are determined by role, level, and location. Our job titles may span more than one career level. Within the range, individual compensation is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, relevant education or training, business need, market demands. The compensation range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. Your recruiter can share more about the specific compensation range for your location during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Denver Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$141,162&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$176,452.50 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% employer-paid medical insurance&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Generous paid time away from work, including paid vacation or flexible/unlimited vacation depending on role and country, plus paid sick time, inclusive parental leave, paid holidays, including a year-end Global Week of Rest, and volunteer days off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RSU stock grants*&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development and training opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company virtual happy hours, free food, and fun team-building activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly cell phone stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to an innovative mental health support platform that offers personalized care and resources in areas such as: therapy, coaching, and self-guided mindfulness exercises for all covered employees and their covered dependents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;May vary by country and worker type - please reach out to your recruiter for more information&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CdawUwjo1Q1B7ghZJ_owdmmHB8VtqhBu?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about Fivetran&#39;s Benefits by Region.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;We’re honored to be &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;valued at over $5.6 billion&lt;/a&gt;, but more importantly, we’re proud of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;core values of Get Stuck In, Do the Right Thing, and One Team, One Dream&lt;/a&gt;. Read about us in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Forbes&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;Fivetran brings together high-quality talent across the globe to make data access as easy and reliable as electricity for our customers. We value and recognize that our customers benefit from having innovative teams made of people from many backgrounds, experiences, and identities. Fivetran promotes diversity, equity, inclusion &amp;amp; belonging through attracting, recruiting, developing, and retaining a diverse workforce, not only because it is the right thing to do, but because it helps us build a world-class company to better serve our customers, our people and our communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about Fivetran’s culture and what it’s like to be part of the team, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xlhtp4dGh8o&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; and enjoy our video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about our candidate privacy policy, you can &lt;a href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/candidate-privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;read our statement here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to ensuring that all candidates have an equal opportunity to participate in our interview process. If you require accommodations at any stage of the process due to a disability, medical condition, or any other circumstance, please don&#39;t hesitate to submit your request by filling out this &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/V7k3t4u9j523XkEt6&quot;&gt;form&lt;/a&gt;. We will work with you to provide reasonable accommodations to facilitate your participation and ensure a fair and accessible interview experience. Your request and any information provided will be kept confidential and will not impact your candidacy. We look forward to hearing from you and accommodating your needs to the best of our ability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":4163840003,"name":"Strategy & Operations Department","child_ids":[],"parent_id":4051565003}],"offices":[{"id":4015137003,"name":"USA - Oakland","location":"Oakland, California, United States, AMER","child_ids":[],"parent_id":4035898003}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":false,"ai_opt_out_request_url":"http://app3.greenhouse.io/ai_opt_out_request/job_post/8009202003/ai_opt_out"},{"absolute_url":"https://www.fivetran.com/careers/job?gh_jid=8037292003","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":5904659003,"location":{"name":"Oakland, California, United States, AMER"},"metadata":[{"id":4426110003,"name":"Employee Type","value":"Regular","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":41172869003,"name":"Priority Status","value":null,"value_type":"short_text"}],"id":8037292003,"updated_at":"2026-10-26T17:43:00-04:00","requisition_id":"JR103474","title":"GTM Finance Manager","company_name":"Fivetran ","first_published":"2026-10-26T17:42:18-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;From Fivetran’s founding until now, our mission has remained the same: to make access to data as simple and reliable as electricity. With Fivetran, customer data arrives in their warehouses, canonical and ready to query, with no engineering or maintenance required. We’re proud that more organizations continue to leverage our technology every day to become truly data-driven.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fivetran and dbt Labs are bringing together two industry-leading companies with a shared mission: helping organizations unlock the full value of their data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Together, we’re delivering the data infrastructure layer that helps organizations move, transform, and trust their data — from the moment data moves, through every transformation, to the context teams and AI systems rely on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fivetran helps organizations automate data movement across the systems, clouds, engines, and tools they rely on. dbt Labs pioneered analytics engineering, helping teams transform data into reliable, governed insights. Together, we support thousands of organizations as they build a trusted foundation for analytics, AI, and better business decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we bring our teams and technology together, we’re building on the strengths of both companies while continuing to deliver the products and experiences our customers know and trust. It’s an exciting time to join us: we’re creating a company with the scale, talent, and technology to help more organizations put their data to work with greater speed, confidence, and impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;During this transition period, you may see references to both Fivetran and dbt Labs throughout our recruiting process as we integrate our teams, systems, and career sites.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fivetran is building data pipelines to power the modern data stack for thousands of companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Manager on the GTM Finance and Strategy team, you’ll operate at the center of go-to-market strategy — owning and building critical models to forecast ARR and GAAP Revenue, analyzing and providing perspective around strategic initiatives, and delivering insights that shape executive and Board decisions. You’ll partner closely with Analytics, Revenue Accounting, Revenue Operations, External Reporting, and GTM leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role reports to the Sr. Manager of GTM Finance and blends strategic finance, data storytelling, technical problem-solving, and operational execution. You’ll drive forward-looking planning, help scale our forecasting infrastructure for a hybrid pricing motion that includes both subscription contracts and usage-based (consumption) revenue, and support high-visibility initiatives across the function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact role ideal for someone who is passionate about leveraging data and financial insight to guide strategy and operational execution in a high-growth, cross-functional environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time, hybrid position based out of our Oakland, CA or Denver, CO office. Our hybrid work model offers a blend of remote flexibility and in-person collaboration, including two days in the office each week to connect and build as a team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tools/Technologies You’ll Use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Claude / ChatGPT, Looker, SFDC, BigQuery, G-Suite&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revenue Modeling &amp;amp; Forecasting: &lt;/strong&gt;Own and re-evaluate our rolling GAAP revenue and ARR forecast models, including renewal behavior (NRR), new business, and contract-level revenue recognition across subscription and consumption-based streams. Evolve forecasting frameworks using both deterministic and AI/ML-driven approaches.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Usage-Based Revenue: &lt;/strong&gt;Build and maintain forecasting approaches for consumption revenue, including committed vs. overage usage, breakage, and the migration of customers between pricing models&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Partnering: &lt;/strong&gt;Serve as a key advisor and partner to COO, CFO, and collaboration with Analytics, delivering actionable insights to improve efficiency, optimize investments, and accelerate growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Decision Support: &lt;/strong&gt;Deliver analysis that informs GTM investment, pricing and packaging, and target setting, and quantify the revenue impact of key business risks and opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Budgeting &amp;amp; Forecasting: &lt;/strong&gt;Support annual planning and monthly/quarterly forecast cycles; partner closely with Revenue Accounting on close, variance analysis, and forecast-to-actual (BvA) tracking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Analysis: &lt;/strong&gt;Own key revenue and retention metric packages — including NRR, ARPA, new business mix, ROI, and cohort trends — and surface insights to the CFO, executives, and the Board&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecast &amp;amp; Reporting Infrastructure: &lt;/strong&gt;Use AI Tools, or SQL (BigQuery) / Python to automate data pulls, build repeatable and auditable models, and improve the accuracy, speed, and transparency of our topline forecast; partner with Analytics, AI Transformation and Systems on data quality, integrity and self-serve reporting capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Create compelling, automated, executive-ready reports, dashboards, and narratives that distill complex data, trends, forecasts, and strategic implications into actionable recommendations for Finance leadership and GTM stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Provide technical guidance, review work, and help raise the modeling standards and work products of the GTM FP&amp;amp;A team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;5-7 years of experience in FP&amp;amp;A, strategic finance, revenue finance, or investment banking, with a strong focus on revenue forecasting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Expert-level modeling skills (Excel/Sheets) with a commitment to formula-driven, driver based, auditable, well-documented models&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience with usage-based or consumption pricing models strongly preferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Technical aptitude: working proficiency in SQL, Python, or similar scripting, and hands-on use of AI tools to accelerate and elevate modeling, strategic analysis, and QA; experience with BI tools (e.g., Looker) and data warehouses (e.g., BigQuery, Snowflake) a plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Ownership mindset: takes a model or process from ambiguity to a repeatable, documented workflow with minimal oversight, including QA and reconciliation to source data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Data storytelling: translates complex data into clear insights and recommendations for senior, non-finance audiences, with strong executive presence and attention to detail&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to partner cross-functionally and influence without authority&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills with high attention to detail and executive presence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Adaptable, resourceful, and excited by the challenge of working in a fast-moving, growth-stage company&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
