&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;We’re honored to be &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;valued at over $5.6 billion&lt;/a&gt;, but more importantly, we’re proud of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;core values of Get Stuck In, Do the Right Thing, and One Team, One Dream&lt;/a&gt;. Read about us in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Forbes&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;Fivetran brings together high-quality talent across the globe to make data access as easy and reliable as electricity for our customers. We value and recognize that our customers benefit from having innovative teams made of people from many backgrounds, experiences, and identities. Fivetran promotes diversity, equity, inclusion &amp;amp; belonging through attracting, recruiting, developing, and retaining a diverse workforce, not only because it is the right thing to do, but because it helps us build a world-class company to better serve our customers, our people and our communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about Fivetran’s culture and what it’s like to be part of the team, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xlhtp4dGh8o&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; and enjoy our video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about our candidate privacy policy, you can &lt;a href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/candidate-privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;read our statement here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to ensuring that all candidates have an equal opportunity to participate in our interview process. If you require accommodations at any stage of the process due to a disability, medical condition, or any other circumstance, please don&#39;t hesitate to submit your request by filling out this &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/V7k3t4u9j523XkEt6&quot;&gt;form&lt;/a&gt;. We will work with you to provide reasonable accommodations to facilitate your participation and ensure a fair and accessible interview experience. Your request and any information provided will be kept confidential and will not impact your candidacy. We look forward to hearing from you and accommodating your needs to the best of our ability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":4023488003,"name":"Alliances Department","child_ids":[],"parent_id":4051565003}],"offices":[{"id":4052529003,"name":"JPN - Remote","location":"Remote, Japan, APAC","child_ids":[],"parent_id":4052528003}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":false,"ai_opt_out_request_url":"http://app3.greenhouse.io/ai_opt_out_request/job_post/7818344003/ai_opt_out"},{"absolute_url":"https://www.fivetran.com/careers/job?gh_jid=8008322003","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":5891498003,"location":{"name":"Remote, Any, United States, AMER"},"metadata":[{"id":4426110003,"name":"Employee Type","value":"Regular","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":41172869003,"name":"Priority Status","value":null,"value_type":"short_text"}],"id":8008322003,"updated_at":"2026-10-23T08:18:47-04:00","requisition_id":"JR103435","title":"Partner Solutions Architect","company_name":"Fivetran ","first_published":"2026-10-13T12:47:14-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;From Fivetran’s founding until now, our mission has remained the same: to make access to data as simple and reliable as electricity. With Fivetran, customer data arrives in their warehouses, canonical and ready to query, with no engineering or maintenance required. We’re proud that more organizations continue to leverage our technology every day to become truly data-driven.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Fivetran and dbt Labs are bringing together two industry-leading companies with a shared mission: helping organizations unlock the full value of their data. Together, we’re delivering the data infrastructure layer that helps organizations move, transform, and trust their data — from the moment data moves, through every transformation, to the context teams and AI systems rely on. Fivetran helps organizations automate data movement across the systems, clouds, engines, and tools they rely on. dbt Labs pioneered analytics engineering, helping teams transform data into reliable, governed insights. Together, we support thousands of organizations as they build a trusted foundation for analytics, AI, and better business decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As we bring our teams and technology together, we’re building on the strengths of both companies while continuing to deliver the products and experiences our customers know and trust. It’s an exciting time to join us: we’re creating a company with the scale, talent, and technology to help more organizations put their data to work with greater speed, confidence, and impact.&amp;nbsp;During this transition period, you may see references to both Fivetran and dbt Labs throughout our recruiting process as we integrate our teams, systems, and career sites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Partner Solutions Architect to own the global technical relationship with Snowflake and Databricks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Snowflake and Databricks are two of Fivetran + dbt Labs’ largest platform alliances. This is a global role scoped to those two partners. For each, you will own the technical alliance plan worldwide, the joint technical narrative, and our joint integration and roadmap priorities with each partner to drive cosell revenue. You will also own our technical presence at major milestones such as Snowflake Summit and Databricks Data + AI Summit, our two largest partner events.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Functionally, the role sits at the intersection of field engineering, product management, partnerships, and partner marketing. Your closest counterparts are the global alliance managers for Snowflake and Databricks, the regional partner sales managers who run the Snowflake and Databricks motions in AMER, EMEA and APJ, the geo partner solutions architects, and product managers across both product lines. You will report to the global head of partner solutions architecture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a full-time position, which can be either remote (US) or hybrid depending on location. Our hybrid work model offers a blend of remote flexibility and in-person collaboration, including two days in the office each week to connect and build as a team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own the global technical alliance plans for Snowflake and Databricks. Build each plan with the partner&#39;s alliance and product leadership, agree it with our own, and drive it through both field organizations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own the joint technical narrative and the capability messaging for the combined dbt + Fivetran platform on Snowflake and Databricks, including reference architectures, integration patterns, and the joint value story that partners and sellers use with customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Build reusable collateral, playbooks and enablement assets for the broader partner solutions architecture team and for the partners delivering on Snowflake and Databricks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain a single, current view of integration state, gaps and opportunities across the combined platform on Snowflake and Databricks, covering ingestion, transformation, Fusion, the semantic layer, catalog and metadata, open table formats, and agent and MCP interfaces, and collaborate with our Product organization to drive the right outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Serve as the primary technical counterpart to the partner engineering and partner product teams at Snowflake and Databricks, and run the standing technical cadence with each.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own our technical presence at Snowflake Summit and Databricks Data + AI Summit, including hands-on labs, sessions, demos, and the technical readiness of the team who staff each event.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with the regional Partner Solutions Architects and Partnerships organization so global alliance strategy turns into regional execution, and so they can run the motion without you in the room.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Travel approximately 30% for alliance planning, technical workshops, executive meetings and partner events, including international travel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;6+ years in solutions architecture, sales engineering, partner engineering, technical product management, developer relations, or another customer-facing technical role in data and analytics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Fluency across the modern data stack (ingestion, transformation, orchestration, warehouses and lakehouses, open table formats, semantic layers, catalogs, BI, and the emerging agent and MCP layer) and the ability to explain how the pieces fit.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Hands-on knowledge of Snowflake and/or Databricks, plus strong SQL and data modeling fundamentals, with genuine technical credibility in front of partner engineers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Sound product and strategic judgment and reasoning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong presentation and facilitation skills for workshops, hands-on labs, keynote-adjacent sessions and large partner technical audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Proven ability to drive outcomes in ambiguous, fast-moving environments with multiple stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Skills​&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience owning a technical alliance, with a track record of shaping what a partner built and how the two products fit together&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with partner-facing APIs, SDKs, drivers, or integration certification programs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Background in product management or technical product marketing alongside a field engineering career&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with cloud marketplace motions and co-sell programs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;OTE (On Target Earning)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$209,748&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$262,185.60 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% employer-paid medical insurance&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Generous paid time away from work, including paid vacation or flexible/unlimited vacation depending on role and country, plus paid sick time, inclusive parental leave, paid holidays, including a year-end Global Week of Rest, and volunteer days off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RSU stock grants*&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development and training opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company virtual happy hours, free food, and fun team-building activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly cell phone stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to an innovative mental health support platform that offers personalized care and resources in areas such as: therapy, coaching, and self-guided mindfulness exercises for all covered employees and their covered dependents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;May vary by country and worker type - please reach out to your recruiter for more information&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CdawUwjo1Q1B7ghZJ_owdmmHB8VtqhBu?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about Fivetran&#39;s Benefits by Region.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;We’re honored to be &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;valued at over $5.6 billion&lt;/a&gt;, but more importantly, we’re proud of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;core values of Get Stuck In, Do the Right Thing, and One Team, One Dream&lt;/a&gt;. Read about us in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Forbes&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;Fivetran brings together high-quality talent across the globe to make data access as easy and reliable as electricity for our customers. We value and recognize that our customers benefit from having innovative teams made of people from many backgrounds, experiences, and identities. Fivetran promotes diversity, equity, inclusion &amp;amp; belonging through attracting, recruiting, developing, and retaining a diverse workforce, not only because it is the right thing to do, but because it helps us build a world-class company to better serve our customers, our people and our communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about Fivetran’s culture and what it’s like to be part of the team, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xlhtp4dGh8o&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; and enjoy our video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about our candidate privacy policy, you can &lt;a href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/candidate-privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;read our statement here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to ensuring that all candidates have an equal opportunity to participate in our interview process. If you require accommodations at any stage of the process due to a disability, medical condition, or any other circumstance, please don&#39;t hesitate to submit your request by filling out this &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/V7k3t4u9j523XkEt6&quot;&gt;form&lt;/a&gt;. We will work with you to provide reasonable accommodations to facilitate your participation and ensure a fair and accessible interview experience. Your request and any information provided will be kept confidential and will not impact your candidacy. We look forward to hearing from you and accommodating your needs to the best of our ability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":4023507003,"name":"Sales Department","child_ids":[4171502003],"parent_id":4051565003}],"offices":[{"id":4037450003,"name":"USA - Remote - MI","location":"Remote, Michigan, United States, AMER","child_ids":[],"parent_id":4035898003}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":false,"ai_opt_out_request_url":"http://app3.greenhouse.io/ai_opt_out_request/job_post/8008322003/ai_opt_out"},{"absolute_url":"https://www.fivetran.com/careers/job?gh_jid=8005784003","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":5888511003,"location":{"name":"Oakland, California, United States, AMER"},"metadata":[{"id":4426110003,"name":"Employee Type","value":"Regular","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":41172869003,"name":"Priority Status","value":null,"value_type":"short_text"}],"id":8005784003,"updated_at":"2026-10-06T15:06:46-04:00","requisition_id":"JR103419","title":"Pricing & Order Operations Analyst","company_name":"Fivetran ","first_published":"2026-09-25T16:49:49-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;From Fivetran’s founding until now, our mission has remained the same: to make access to data as simple and reliable as electricity. With Fivetran, customer data arrives in their warehouses, canonical and ready to query, with no engineering or maintenance required. We’re proud that more organizations continue to leverage our technology every day to become truly data-driven.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Fivetran and dbt Labs are bringing together two industry-leading companies with a shared mission: helping organizations unlock the full value of their data. Together, we’re delivering the data infrastructure layer that helps organizations move, transform, and trust their data — from the moment data moves, through every transformation, to the context teams and AI systems rely on. Fivetran helps organizations automate data movement across the systems, clouds, engines, and tools they rely on. dbt Labs pioneered analytics engineering, helping teams transform data into reliable, governed insights. Together, we support thousands of organizations as they build a trusted foundation for analytics, AI, and better business decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As we bring our teams and technology together, we’re building on both companies&#39; strengths while continuing to deliver the products and experiences our customers know and trust. It’s an exciting time to join us: we’re creating a company with the scale, talent, and technology to help more organizations put their data to work with greater speed, confidence, and impact. During this transition period, you may see references to both Fivetran and dbt Labs throughout our recruiting process as we integrate our teams, systems, and career sites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Fivetran is building data pipelines to power the modern data stack for thousands of companies.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Pricing &amp;amp; Order Operations Analyst&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Order Operations &amp;amp; Monetization team. This role restores dedicated capacity for pricing and order operations testing, quote-to-cash (QTC) release validation, and order execution support.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You’ll help ensure system changes are tested, validated, and operationally ready before they go live. You’ll provide Pricing and Order Operations subject-matter expertise and execute assigned business validation across signature packets, bookings, marketplace offers, and booking-to-order management handoffs. This role partners closely with Order Operations &amp;amp; Monetization, IT’s business systems team, Pricing Operations, Sales, and Deal Desk.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Prioritization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Reports to the Order Operations &amp;amp; Monetization lead, Jamie Calkins.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The Senior Pricing Operations Manager may help prioritize pricing-related test cases and QTC issues tied specifically to pricing and quoting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The Order Operations &amp;amp; Monetization lead owns final prioritization of the analyst’s workload across order operations, assigned non-pricing UAT participation, and pricing-related support work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a hybrid role, 1-2 days in the office.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Technologies You’ll Use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Salesforce CPQ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Jira&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Suger and marketplace user interfaces, including AWS, Azure, GCP, and Snowflake&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Notion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Metronome&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Hex&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pricing Operations &amp;amp; QTC Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support pricing operations changes through business requirement review, data validation, configuration checks, and documentation, helping ensure pricing logic is accurately reflected in QTC workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Validate pricing-related QTC changes across quoting, approvals, discounting logic, product configuration, and downstream order execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Help confirm that pricing changes are operationally ready before launch, including impacts to Sales, Deal Desk, Order Operations, Billing, Revenue, and marketplace workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with the Senior Pricing Operations Manager to prioritize pricing-related test cases, identify gaps in business requirements, and document expected system behavior.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Help maintain documentation for pricing- and order-related system configurations, known dependencies, and release-readiness criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;UAT &amp;amp; Testing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Participate as a Pricing and Order Operations subject-matter expert in UAT project-managed by Technical Program Management (TPM) and executed under RevOps coordination, ensuring relevant business scenarios and expected outcomes are represented.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Execute assigned Pricing and Order Operations test cases and collaborate with the GTM subject-matter experts identified by RevOps.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with RevOps and relevant subject-matter experts to develop and maintain Pricing and Order Operations test cases, including scenarios for quoting, approvals, signature packets, bookings, marketplace offers, billing, and order management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Document test results and defects with clear traceability from business requirement to test outcome, and provide domain-specific readiness input through the established UAT sign-off process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain the Pricing and Order Operations portion of the regression test suite for recurring QTC changes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Order Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Operate under defined business requirements for order operations rules within the QTC flow, validating execution across signature packet generation and e-signature routing, booking rules, marketplace offer configuration—including AWS, Azure, GCP, and Snowflake—and the booking-to-order management handoff.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with IT’s business systems team and the Proposal-to-Order Lead to keep order operations rules aligned with upstream pricing and quoting logic and downstream billing and revenue systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ensure signature packets and marketplace offers accurately reflect the underlying order and pricing terms before execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Identify and troubleshoot order operations issues across bookings, signature packets, and marketplace offers, escalating systemic problems to the appropriate system owner.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;2–3 years of experience in pricing operations, order operations, business systems analysis, or quality assurance within an agile environment, ideally involving quote-to-cash processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of Salesforce CPQ and order management or billing systems, with the ability to read and understand configuration logic without necessarily building it directly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong attention to detail and comfort performing structured, repeatable testing work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Comfort using conversational AI tools—such as Claude, ChatGPT, or internal chatbots—to support daily and project work, combined with sound judgment about when human review or decision-making is necessary.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Clear written communication skills, with the ability to document test cases, defects, and sign-off criteria for technical and business audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A proactive and organized approach, with the ability to work across IT, Pricing and Order Operations, and Sales and Deal Desk without heavy oversight.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Skills​&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Exposure to Revenue Recognition or Professional Services systems and processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
