&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about our candidate privacy policy, you can &lt;a href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/candidate-privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;read our statement here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to ensuring that all candidates have an equal opportunity to participate in our interview process. If you require accommodations at any stage of the process due to a disability, medical condition, or any other circumstance, please don&#39;t hesitate to submit your request by filling out this &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/V7k3t4u9j523XkEt6&quot;&gt;form&lt;/a&gt;. We will work with you to provide reasonable accommodations to facilitate your participation and ensure a fair and accessible interview experience. Your request and any information provided will be kept confidential and will not impact your candidacy. We look forward to hearing from you and accommodating your needs to the best of our ability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":4023507003,"name":"Sales Department","child_ids":[4171502003],"parent_id":4051565003}],"offices":[{"id":4037415003,"name":"DEU - Remote","location":"Remote, Germany, EMEA","child_ids":[],"parent_id":4035906003}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":false,"ai_opt_out_request_url":"http://app3.greenhouse.io/ai_opt_out_request/job_post/7659463003/ai_opt_out"},{"absolute_url":"https://www.fivetran.com/careers/job?gh_jid=7897681003","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":5839233003,"location":{"name":"Remote, Any, Sweden"},"metadata":[{"id":4426110003,"name":"Employee Type","value":"Regular","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":41172869003,"name":"Priority Status","value":null,"value_type":"short_text"}],"id":7897681003,"updated_at":"2026-10-08T06:46:42-04:00","requisition_id":"JR103363","title":"Senior Account Executive, Enterprise","company_name":"Fivetran ","first_published":"2026-09-02T04:42:11-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;From Fivetran’s founding until now, our mission has remained the same: to make access to data as simple and reliable as electricity. With Fivetran, customer data arrives in their warehouses, canonical and ready to query, with no engineering or maintenance required. We’re proud that more organizations continue to leverage our technology every day to become truly data-driven.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fivetran and dbt Labs are bringing together two industry-leading companies with a shared mission: helping organizations unlock the full value of their data.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Together, we’re delivering the data infrastructure layer that helps organizations move, transform, and trust their data — from the moment data moves, through every transformation, to the context teams and AI systems rely on.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fivetran helps organizations automate data movement across the systems, clouds, engines, and tools they rely on. dbt Labs pioneered analytics engineering, helping teams transform data into reliable, governed insights. Together, we support thousands of organizations as they build a trusted foundation for analytics, AI, and better business decisions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As we bring our teams and technology together, we’re building on the strengths of both companies while continuing to deliver the products and experiences our customers know and trust. It’s an exciting time to join us: we’re creating a company with the scale, talent, and technology to help more organizations put their data to work with greater speed, confidence, and impact.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;During this transition period, you may see references to both Fivetran and dbt Labs throughout our recruiting process as we integrate our teams, systems, and career sites.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Fivetran + dbt Labs is building data pipelines to power the modern data stack for thousands of companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for an Enterprise Account Executive to join our growing EMEA team, specifically working with customers and prospects in the Nordics. In this role, you’ll partner with leading enterprise businesses to understand their needs, deliver solutions, and build long-term relationships that drive mutual success. You’ll manage a full sales cycle, develop new opportunities, and collaborate across teams to achieve results. Fivetran has already developed a strong customer base in the region and now is the time to accelerate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;If you’re motivated by creating value for customers, enjoy working in a collaborative environment, and want to make an impact at a fast-growing company, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;This is a full-time, remote role based in the UK or Ireland, with a strong preference for candidates located in the London or Dublin area.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies You’ll Use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Salesforce&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Clari&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Gong&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Looker&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Demandware&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Ironclad&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Workday&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Contribute to dbt/Fivetran’s growth in the enterprise segment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Learn the fundamentals of dbt/Fivetran’s technology, sales cycle, and customer base within your first 30 days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Consistently build strong pipeline by establishing relationships with prospects and clients, focused on where we can deliver business value for them&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Consistently achieve quarterly revenue goals while maintaining a consultative, customer-first approach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Forecast and manage your sales pipeline with accuracy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with teammates by sharing insights, tactics, and best practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Strategically engage with C-level executives, IT leaders, and technical users.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Partner with internal stakeholders to ensure customer success at every stage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Travel to the region around twice per quarter.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Strong relationship-building skills with customers and colleagues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Excellent pipeline generation capabilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Strategic thinker who can see the big picture and communicate it clearly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Analytical and curious; able to identify opportunities and challenges through thoughtful evaluation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Motivated and positive; you bring persistence and energy to achieving goals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Adaptable and flexible when priorities shift or conditions change.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience selling enterprise solutions (typically 5+ years), with a record of delivering results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Skills​&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the Nordic technology market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot; data-notion-highlight=&quot;default&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote &lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;#LI-DJ2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% employer-paid medical insurance&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Generous paid time away from work, including paid vacation or flexible/unlimited vacation depending on role and country, plus paid sick time, inclusive parental leave, paid holidays, including a year-end Global Week of Rest, and volunteer days off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RSU stock grants*&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development and training opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company virtual happy hours, free food, and fun team-building activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly cell phone stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to an innovative mental health support platform that offers personalized care and resources in areas such as: therapy, coaching, and self-guided mindfulness exercises for all covered employees and their covered dependents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;May vary by country and worker type - please reach out to your recruiter for more information&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CdawUwjo1Q1B7ghZJ_owdmmHB8VtqhBu?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about Fivetran&#39;s Benefits by Region.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;We’re honored to be &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;valued at over $5.6 billion&lt;/a&gt;, but more importantly, we’re proud of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;core values of Get Stuck In, Do the Right Thing, and One Team, One Dream&lt;/a&gt;. Read about us in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Forbes&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;Fivetran brings together high-quality talent across the globe to make data access as easy and reliable as electricity for our customers. We value and recognize that our customers benefit from having innovative teams made of people from many backgrounds, experiences, and identities. Fivetran promotes diversity, equity, inclusion &amp;amp; belonging through attracting, recruiting, developing, and retaining a diverse workforce, not only because it is the right thing to do, but because it helps us build a world-class company to better serve our customers, our people and our communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about Fivetran’s culture and what it’s like to be part of the team, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xlhtp4dGh8o&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; and enjoy our video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about our candidate privacy policy, you can &lt;a href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/candidate-privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;read our statement here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to ensuring that all candidates have an equal opportunity to participate in our interview process. If you require accommodations at any stage of the process due to a disability, medical condition, or any other circumstance, please don&#39;t hesitate to submit your request by filling out this &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/V7k3t4u9j523XkEt6&quot;&gt;form&lt;/a&gt;. We will work with you to provide reasonable accommodations to facilitate your participation and ensure a fair and accessible interview experience. Your request and any information provided will be kept confidential and will not impact your candidacy. We look forward to hearing from you and accommodating your needs to the best of our ability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":4023507003,"name":"Sales Department","child_ids":[4171502003],"parent_id":4051565003}],"offices":[{"id":4139888003,"name":"SWE - Remote","location":null,"child_ids":[],"parent_id":4139883003}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":false,"ai_opt_out_request_url":"http://app3.greenhouse.io/ai_opt_out_request/job_post/7897681003/ai_opt_out"},{"absolute_url":"https://www.fivetran.com/careers/job?gh_jid=7975857003","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":5849194003,"location":{"name":"USA - New York (dbt)"},"metadata":[{"id":4426110003,"name":"Employee Type","value":"Regular","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":41172869003,"name":"Priority Status","value":null,"value_type":"short_text"}],"id":7975857003,"updated_at":"2026-10-02T17:56:39-04:00","requisition_id":"JR103366","title":"Senior Data Analyst, People","company_name":"Fivetran ","first_published":"2026-08-25T14:03:43-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;From Fivetran’s founding until now, our mission has remained the same: to make access to data as simple and reliable as electricity. With Fivetran, customer data arrives in their warehouses, canonical and ready to query, with no engineering or maintenance required. We’re proud that more organizations continue to leverage our technology every day to become truly data-driven.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Fivetran and dbt Labs are bringing together two industry-leading companies with a shared mission: helping organizations unlock the full value of their data. Together, we’re delivering the data infrastructure layer that helps organizations move, transform, and trust their data — from the moment data moves, through every transformation, to the context teams and AI systems rely on. Fivetran helps organizations automate data movement across the systems, clouds, engines, and tools they rely on. dbt Labs pioneered analytics engineering, helping teams transform data into reliable, governed insights. Together, we support thousands of organizations as they build a trusted foundation for analytics, AI, and better business decisions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As we bring our teams and technology together, we’re building on the strengths of both companies while continuing to deliver the products and experiences our customers know and trust. It’s an exciting time to join us: we’re creating a company with the scale, talent, and technology to help more organizations put their data to work with greater speed, confidence, and impact. During this transition period, you may see references to both Fivetran and dbt Labs throughout our recruiting process as we integrate our teams, systems, and career sites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We’re hiring a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Analyst to support our People organization&lt;/strong&gt;, using data to help Fivetran attract, develop, engage, and retain exceptional talent as we scale. You’ll work across the employee lifecycle — from recruiting and workforce planning to employee experience, learning and development, performance, and retention — turning complex people data into insights that shape how we build and support our teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a high-impact, highly cross-functional role for someone who enjoys operating at the intersection of &lt;strong&gt;data, people, and strategy&lt;/strong&gt;. You’ll partner closely with leaders across People, Recruiting, Finance, and the broader business to answer important organizational questions, develop scalable analytical frameworks, and improve how decisions are made.&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;This is a full-time, flexible hybrid position based out of our Oakland, CA or NYC, NY office. Our hybrid work model offers a blend of remote flexibility and in-person collaboration. There is no mandate on the number of days required but we encourage employees to come in every week to collaborate.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies You’ll Use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;SQL (BigQuery / Snowflake)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;dbt / dbt State&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Looker / LookML&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Sigma / Hex / Google Sheets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Claude Code / Codex&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;HRIS, ATS, and other People systems and data sources&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and own our core People metrics.&lt;/strong&gt; Establish clear definitions and reporting across areas such as headcount, hiring, retention, organizational health, employee experience, and talent development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build scalable analytical products.&lt;/strong&gt; Create canonical datasets, models, and self-service tools and dashboards that enable People teams and leaders to answer important questions quickly and consistently.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Serve as a trusted thought partner.&lt;/strong&gt; Translate analyses into clear narratives and recommendations for audiences ranging from functional operators to senior executive leadership. Work closely with our Engineers to improve Fivetran&#39;s own HRIS and ATS connectors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set a high bar for responsible People Analytics.&lt;/strong&gt; Help establish strong practices around data quality, integrity, governance, privacy, appropriate access, and the responsible use of sensitive employee data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn people data into decisions.&lt;/strong&gt; Analyze complex and disparate datasets to identify trends, surface opportunities, and provide actionable recommendations to People leaders and business stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape our analytics culture.&lt;/strong&gt; Mentor other analysts and partners, establish analytical best practices, and help People teams develop stronger data fluency and decision-making habits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in analytics, data science, business intelligence, or a related analytical role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Advanced proficiency in SQL and data modeling, with experience working across large, complex datasets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience using Looker, Tableau, Sigma, or similar business intelligence and visualization tools&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong analytical judgment and a track record of translating ambiguous business questions into structured analyses and actionable recommendations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Exceptional attention to detail and a high bar for data quality, analytical rigor, and reproducibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and data storytelling skills; you can make complex findings intuitive and help decision-makers understand not just what is happening, but why it matters and what to do next&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Comfort operating in ambiguity, developing hypotheses, and owning analytical problems end-to-end&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong cross-functional instincts and the ability to build trusted relationships with both technical and non-technical partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A builder mindset: you look beyond answering one-off questions and create frameworks, datasets, and tools that make future decisions faster and better&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Passion for using data to improve how organizations attract, develop, and support their people&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience using analytics to support key business decisions, preferably at a high-growth, SaaS, or B2B product company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience in People Analytics, workforce analytics, recruiting analytics, HR strategy, or another People-related analytical function&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with HRIS, ATS, performance management, engagement, or learning systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID #LI-DJ1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The compensation range displayed on this job posting reflects the minimum and maximum target for new hire compensation for the target position and level, and may include sales incentives or target bonuses depending on the role. &amp;nbsp;Our compensation ranges are determined by role, level, and location. Our job titles may span more than one career level. Within the range, individual compensation is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, relevant education or training, business need, market demands. The compensation range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. Your recruiter can share more about the specific compensation range for your location during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;New York Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$156,082&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$195,102.50 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% employer-paid medical insurance&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Generous paid time away from work, including paid vacation or flexible/unlimited vacation depending on role and country, plus paid sick time, inclusive parental leave, paid holidays, including a year-end Global Week of Rest, and volunteer days off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RSU stock grants*&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development and training opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company virtual happy hours, free food, and fun team-building activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly cell phone stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to an innovative mental health support platform that offers personalized care and resources in areas such as: therapy, coaching, and self-guided mindfulness exercises for all covered employees and their covered dependents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;May vary by country and worker type - please reach out to your recruiter for more information&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CdawUwjo1Q1B7ghZJ_owdmmHB8VtqhBu?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about Fivetran&#39;s Benefits by Region.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;We’re honored to be &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;valued at over $5.6 billion&lt;/a&gt;, but more importantly, we’re proud of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;core values of Get Stuck In, Do the Right Thing, and One Team, One Dream&lt;/a&gt;. Read about us in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Forbes&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;Fivetran brings together high-quality talent across the globe to make data access as easy and reliable as electricity for our customers. We value and recognize that our customers benefit from having innovative teams made of people from many backgrounds, experiences, and identities. Fivetran promotes diversity, equity, inclusion &amp;amp; belonging through attracting, recruiting, developing, and retaining a diverse workforce, not only because it is the right thing to do, but because it helps us build a world-class company to better serve our customers, our people and our communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about Fivetran’s culture and what it’s like to be part of the team, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xlhtp4dGh8o&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; and enjoy our video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about our candidate privacy policy, you can &lt;a href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/candidate-privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;read our statement here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to ensuring that all candidates have an equal opportunity to participate in our interview process. If you require accommodations at any stage of the process due to a disability, medical condition, or any other circumstance, please don&#39;t hesitate to submit your request by filling out this &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/V7k3t4u9j523XkEt6&quot;&gt;form&lt;/a&gt;. We will work with you to provide reasonable accommodations to facilitate your participation and ensure a fair and accessible interview experience. Your request and any information provided will be kept confidential and will not impact your candidacy. We look forward to hearing from you and accommodating your needs to the best of our ability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":4023489003,"name":"Analytics Department","child_ids":[],"parent_id":4051563003}],"offices":[{"id":4015137003,"name":"USA - Oakland","location":"Oakland, California, United States, AMER","child_ids":[],"parent_id":4035898003}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":false,"ai_opt_out_request_url":"http://app3.greenhouse.io/ai_opt_out_request/job_post/7975857003/ai_opt_out"},{"absolute_url":"https://www.fivetran.com/careers/job?gh_jid=7918612003","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":5849194003,"location":{"name":"Oakland, California, United States, AMER"},"metadata":[{"id":4426110003,"name":"Employee Type","value":"Regular","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":41172869003,"name":"Priority Status","value":null,"value_type":"short_text"}],"id":7918612003,"updated_at":"2026-10-02T17:56:39-04:00","requisition_id":"JR103366","title":"Senior Data Analyst, People","company_name":"Fivetran ","first_published":"2026-08-25T14:01:45-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;From Fivetran’s founding until now, our mission has remained the same: to make access to data as simple and reliable as electricity. With Fivetran, customer data arrives in their warehouses, canonical and ready to query, with no engineering or maintenance required. We’re proud that more organizations continue to leverage our technology every day to become truly data-driven.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Fivetran and dbt Labs are bringing together two industry-leading companies with a shared mission: helping organizations unlock the full value of their data. Together, we’re delivering the data infrastructure layer that helps organizations move, transform, and trust their data — from the moment data moves, through every transformation, to the context teams and AI systems rely on. Fivetran helps organizations automate data movement across the systems, clouds, engines, and tools they rely on. dbt Labs pioneered analytics engineering, helping teams transform data into reliable, governed insights. Together, we support thousands of organizations as they build a trusted foundation for analytics, AI, and better business decisions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As we bring our teams and technology together, we’re building on the strengths of both companies while continuing to deliver the products and experiences our customers know and trust. It’s an exciting time to join us: we’re creating a company with the scale, talent, and technology to help more organizations put their data to work with greater speed, confidence, and impact. During this transition period, you may see references to both Fivetran and dbt Labs throughout our recruiting process as we integrate our teams, systems, and career sites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We’re hiring a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Analyst to support our People organization&lt;/strong&gt;, using data to help Fivetran attract, develop, engage, and retain exceptional talent as we scale. You’ll work across the employee lifecycle — from recruiting and workforce planning to employee experience, learning and development, performance, and retention — turning complex people data into insights that shape how we build and support our teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a high-impact, highly cross-functional role for someone who enjoys operating at the intersection of &lt;strong&gt;data, people, and strategy&lt;/strong&gt;. You’ll partner closely with leaders across People, Recruiting, Finance, and the broader business to answer important organizational questions, develop scalable analytical frameworks, and improve how decisions are made.&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;This is a full-time, flexible hybrid position based out of our Oakland, CA or NYC, NY office. Our hybrid work model offers a blend of remote flexibility and in-person collaboration. There is no mandate on the number of days required but we encourage employees to come in every week to collaborate.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies You’ll Use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;SQL (BigQuery / Snowflake)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;dbt / dbt State&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Looker / LookML&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Sigma / Hex / Google Sheets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Claude Code / Codex&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;HRIS, ATS, and other People systems and data sources&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and own our core People metrics.&lt;/strong&gt; Establish clear definitions and reporting across areas such as headcount, hiring, retention, organizational health, employee experience, and talent development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build scalable analytical products.&lt;/strong&gt; Create canonical datasets, models, and self-service tools and dashboards that enable People teams and leaders to answer important questions quickly and consistently.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Serve as a trusted thought partner.&lt;/strong&gt; Translate analyses into clear narratives and recommendations for audiences ranging from functional operators to senior executive leadership. Work closely with our Engineers to improve Fivetran&#39;s own HRIS and ATS connectors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set a high bar for responsible People Analytics.&lt;/strong&gt; Help establish strong practices around data quality, integrity, governance, privacy, appropriate access, and the responsible use of sensitive employee data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn people data into decisions.&lt;/strong&gt; Analyze complex and disparate datasets to identify trends, surface opportunities, and provide actionable recommendations to People leaders and business stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape our analytics culture.&lt;/strong&gt; Mentor other analysts and partners, establish analytical best practices, and help People teams develop stronger data fluency and decision-making habits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in analytics, data science, business intelligence, or a related analytical role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Advanced proficiency in SQL and data modeling, with experience working across large, complex datasets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience using Looker, Tableau, Sigma, or similar business intelligence and visualization tools&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong analytical judgment and a track record of translating ambiguous business questions into structured analyses and actionable recommendations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Exceptional attention to detail and a high bar for data quality, analytical rigor, and reproducibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and data storytelling skills; you can make complex findings intuitive and help decision-makers understand not just what is happening, but why it matters and what to do next&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Comfort operating in ambiguity, developing hypotheses, and owning analytical problems end-to-end&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong cross-functional instincts and the ability to build trusted relationships with both technical and non-technical partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A builder mindset: you look beyond answering one-off questions and create frameworks, datasets, and tools that make future decisions faster and better&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Passion for using data to improve how organizations attract, develop, and support their people&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience using analytics to support key business decisions, preferably at a high-growth, SaaS, or B2B product company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience in People Analytics, workforce analytics, recruiting analytics, HR strategy, or another People-related analytical function&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with HRIS, ATS, performance management, engagement, or learning systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID #LI-DJ1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The compensation range displayed on this job posting reflects the minimum and maximum target for new hire compensation for the target position and level, and may include sales incentives or target bonuses depending on the role. &amp;nbsp;Our compensation ranges are determined by role, level, and location. Our job titles may span more than one career level. Within the range, individual compensation is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, relevant education or training, business need, market demands. The compensation range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. Your recruiter can share more about the specific compensation range for your location during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Oakland Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$156,082&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$195,102.50 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% employer-paid medical insurance&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Generous paid time away from work, including paid vacation or flexible/unlimited vacation depending on role and country, plus paid sick time, inclusive parental leave, paid holidays, including a year-end Global Week of Rest, and volunteer days off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RSU stock grants*&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development and training opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company virtual happy hours, free food, and fun team-building activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly cell phone stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to an innovative mental health support platform that offers personalized care and resources in areas such as: therapy, coaching, and self-guided mindfulness exercises for all covered employees and their covered dependents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;May vary by country and worker type - please reach out to your recruiter for more information&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CdawUwjo1Q1B7ghZJ_owdmmHB8VtqhBu?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about Fivetran&#39;s Benefits by Region.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;We’re honored to be &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;valued at over $5.6 billion&lt;/a&gt;, but more importantly, we’re proud of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;core values of Get Stuck In, Do the Right Thing, and One Team, One Dream&lt;/a&gt;. Read about us in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Forbes&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;Fivetran brings together high-quality talent across the globe to make data access as easy and reliable as electricity for our customers. We value and recognize that our customers benefit from having innovative teams made of people from many backgrounds, experiences, and identities. Fivetran promotes diversity, equity, inclusion &amp;amp; belonging through attracting, recruiting, developing, and retaining a diverse workforce, not only because it is the right thing to do, but because it helps us build a world-class company to better serve our customers, our people and our communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about Fivetran’s culture and what it’s like to be part of the team, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xlhtp4dGh8o&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; and enjoy our video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about our candidate privacy policy, you can &lt;a href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/candidate-privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;read our statement here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to ensuring that all candidates have an equal opportunity to participate in our interview process. If you require accommodations at any stage of the process due to a disability, medical condition, or any other circumstance, please don&#39;t hesitate to submit your request by filling out this &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/V7k3t4u9j523XkEt6&quot;&gt;form&lt;/a&gt;. We will work with you to provide reasonable accommodations to facilitate your participation and ensure a fair and accessible interview experience. Your request and any information provided will be kept confidential and will not impact your candidacy. We look forward to hearing from you and accommodating your needs to the best of our ability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":4023489003,"name":"Analytics Department","child_ids":[],"parent_id":4051563003}],"offices":[{"id":4015137003,"name":"USA - Oakland","location":"Oakland, California, United States, AMER","child_ids":[],"parent_id":4035898003}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":false,"ai_opt_out_request_url":"http://app3.greenhouse.io/ai_opt_out_request/job_post/7918612003/ai_opt_out"},{"absolute_url":"https://www.fivetran.com/careers/job?gh_jid=8008095003","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":true}],"internal_job_id":5891422003,"location":{"name":"Bengaluru, Karnataka, India, APAC"},"metadata":[{"id":4426110003,"name":"Employee Type","value":"Regular","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":41172869003,"name":"Priority Status","value":null,"value_type":"short_text"}],"id":8008095003,"updated_at":"2026-10-08T12:20:30-04:00","requisition_id":"JR103434","title":"Senior Financial Systems Analyst","company_name":"Fivetran ","first_published":"2026-10-08T12:20:30-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;From Fivetran’s founding until now, our mission has remained the same: to make access to data as simple and reliable as electricity. With Fivetran, customer data arrives in their warehouses, canonical and ready to query, with no engineering or maintenance required. We’re proud that more organizations continue to leverage our technology every day to become truly data-driven.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fivetran and dbt Labs are bringing together two industry-leading companies with a shared mission: helping organizations unlock the full value of their data.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Together, we’re delivering the data infrastructure layer that helps organizations move, transform, and trust their data — from the moment data moves, through every transformation, to the context teams and AI systems rely on.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fivetran helps organizations automate data movement across the systems, clouds, engines, and tools they rely on. dbt Labs pioneered analytics engineering, helping teams transform data into reliable, governed insights. Together, we support thousands of organizations as they build a trusted foundation for analytics, AI, and better business decisions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As we bring our teams and technology together, we’re building on the strengths of both companies while continuing to deliver the products and experiences our customers know and trust. It’s an exciting time to join us: we’re creating a company with the scale, talent, and technology to help more organizations put their data to work with greater speed, confidence, and impact.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;During this transition period, you may see references to both Fivetran and dbt Labs throughout our recruiting process as we integrate our teams, systems, and career sites.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Financial Systems Analyst who will drive the transition from manual, repetitive legacy work to more accurate, streamlined, and automated models, dashboards, and data feeds. Your work will change from week-to-week and month-to-month as you partner with FP&amp;amp;A to redesign how the team plans and forecasts, build new dashboards, and train AI agents to do the tedious stuff automatically. We need someone who combines financial acumen with technical know-how — translating model assumptions and drivers into the right long-term solution, whether that&#39;s a Pigment model, a Python script, or an AI agent. You&#39;ll also own the trustworthiness of the numbers Finance leaders rely on, building systematic data-quality checks and partnering with the Data/Analytics Engineering team to resolve upstream data issues. And because a fix that only you can maintain isn&#39;t really a fix, you&#39;ll document your models clearly enough that analysts without a Pigment or Python background can self-serve basic changes — empowering the team with tools that completely solve problems without manual workarounds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time position based out of our Bangalore office. Our hybrid work model offers a blend of remote flexibility and in-person collaboration, including two days in the office each week to connect and build as a team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies You’ll Use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pigment, BigQuery, NetSuite, Omni, Sigma, Claude Code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with FP&amp;amp;A business partners across Sales &amp;amp; Marketing, R&amp;amp;D, and G&amp;amp;A to understand how each team plans, forecasts, and reports today, then work together to identify manual, repetitive Finance work that Pigment integrations, Python scripts, and AI agents can streamline and automate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end build of new and migrated Pigment models — data blocks, formulas, workflows, dashboards, and views — turning fuzzy business asks from FP&amp;amp;A into technical solutions people actually want to use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate on the design and maintenance of our Pigment architecture, ensuring we avoid a tangled mess of metrics, dimensions, and boards and keep our tools easy-to-navigate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team up with your peers on the Finance Systems team to build durable integrations between Pigment, BigQuery, and other finance systems, so the data everyone needs shows up accurately and automatically instead of through manual workarounds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Put systematic data-quality checks in place — reconciliations, change monitoring, variance alerts — so business partners can trust the numbers without manual effort.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document what you build clearly enough that a Finance analyst with no Pigment or Python background can self-serve basic changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Loop in the Data/Analytics Engineering team when a request needs a new data connection or you find an upstream data problem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in financial systems, FP&amp;amp;A, or analytics engineering, with hands-on work in an EPM platform (Pigment, Anaplan, Adaptive, or similar) — or an equivalent analytics-engineering background (SQL, dbt, Python) with a strong interest in moving into EPM/finance systems work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience using AI agents/LLM tooling to automate finance workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to sit with a Finance stakeholder, listen to a messy description of “how we currently do this,” and come back with a well-scoped technical plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working proficiency in Python — or willingness and ability to learn via Claude Code or Codex.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL skills and comfort working in a cloud data warehouse (BigQuery or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail — this role will work on models that inform real business decisions, so the ability to audit models and build intuition on outputs matter as much as speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills — able to explain a data discrepancy or a modeling trade-off to someone without a systems or data background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Skills​&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience inside an FP&amp;amp;A or corporate finance function (not just building tools for one from the outside), ideally supporting a Sales, R&amp;amp;D, or G&amp;amp;A finance function specifically.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience building a Sales Capacity/Planning model or a Supply Chain model in Pigment, Anaplan, or another similar planning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with BI tools such as Tableau, Looker, Sigma, or Omni.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with dbt or another data-transformation framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;#&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;#LI-DB1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% employer-paid medical insurance&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Generous paid time away from work, including paid vacation or flexible/unlimited vacation depending on role and country, plus paid sick time, inclusive parental leave, paid holidays, including a year-end Global Week of Rest, and volunteer days off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RSU stock grants*&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development and training opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company virtual happy hours, free food, and fun team-building activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly cell phone stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to an innovative mental health support platform that offers personalized care and resources in areas such as: therapy, coaching, and self-guided mindfulness exercises for all covered employees and their covered dependents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
