&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience in data processing (ETL, ELT) and/or cloud-based platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
