&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Evaluate and introduce new technologies and approaches to improve developer experience and platform capabilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
